  "worked_solution": "The vertex of a right-opening parabola is the left-most point of the parabola.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14144324/assets/7032a13b6672d8bf66ead31a54577d25bbd47640d8c3cffeedd069d57eec9338.png)\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the vertex are $(3,0).$",
